## Driver SpeexDSP real

```sh
cd <WORKTREE>
OUT=<SCRATCH>/bench REPO=<WORKTREE> \
  sh docs/evidencia/2026-10-29-rx-audio-auto-349/scripts/build_speex_driver.sh
# exit=0
sha256sum <SCRATCH>/bench/speex_driver
# b7e1354da7e86535553a08c9900684fd6fdd4d502ae9ef00c0f31fc3f1f7aa9f
cat <SCRATCH>/bench/build.json
# image=x6200-speexdsp-capture-bench:1.2.1-1
# gcc (Debian 12.2.0-14+deb12u1) 12.2.0
# speexdsp=1.2.1
