## Matriz completa (288 filas, dos pasadas)

```sh
docker run -d --rm --name rx349-bench -v <SCRATCH>:/data:rw -w /data \
  x6200-speexdsp-capture-bench:1.2.1-1 tail -f /dev/null
# container id; exit=0
RX349_BENCH_CONTAINER=rx349-bench RX349_SCRATCH=<SCRATCH> \
  <SCRATCH>/../349-venv/bin/python \
  docs/evidencia/2026-10-29-rx-audio-auto-349/scripts/run_benchmark.py \
  --corpus-dir <CORPUS>/LibriSpeech/test-clean --scratch <SCRATCH> \
  --image x6200-speexdsp-capture-bench:1.2.1-1
# exit=0
# status=DONE_AUTOMATED rows=288 invalid=0 off_ok=true determinism.equal=true
# clipping=false nan=false; controles PASS
docker rm -f rx349-bench
# exit=0
```

## Preflight de radio (sólo lectura; no se cambió nada)

```sh
ssh <RADIO> 'chmod 755 /tmp/x6200-remote; \
  date -u; uname -a; sha256sum /usr/sbin/x6200_gui; md5sum /usr/sbin/x6200_gui; \
  grep -m1 "model name\|Hardware" /proc/cpuinfo; \
  /tmp/x6200-remote "{\"cmd\":\"get\"}"; \
  pactl list short sources; pactl list short sinks; \
  python3 -c "import sqlite3;c=sqlite3.connect(\"/mnt/params.db\");print(list(c.execute(\"select val from params where name=\x27audio_enh_preset\x27\"))[0][0])"; \
  grep -c "CRASHLOG sig" /tmp/x6200_log.txt'
# exit=0; sólo lecturas. Salida resumida en README y manifest.hardware_preflight.
# gate=BASE_NR_DFL_NOT_MEASURED; no TX; no se grabó RX.
```

